[17.427, "o", "You manage three clusters via your OCM hub, and all of them are healthy:\r\n\r\n| Cluster | Available | Kubernetes | Notes |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| cluster1 | ✅ True | v1.30.4 | No unhealthy pods or degraded deployments |\r\n| cluster2 | ✅ True | v1.30.4 | No unhealthy pods or degraded deployments |\r\n| cluster3 | ✅ True | v1.30.4 | No unhealthy pods or degraded deployments |\r\n\r\nAll three are in the `default` ClusterSet, joined and accepted by the hub, with clocks synced and spoke views reporting OK. Nothing needs attention.\r\n"]
[0.506, "o", "\u001b[?25h"]
[2.023, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m# no kubeconfig for the agent - every write needs a human-signed token\u001b[0m\r\n"]
